    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CPL401 · Chapter 3 · Session 27</span>\n<h2>Session 27 — 第三章：文字</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13702 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CPL401 · Chương 3 · Buổi 27</span>\n<h2>Buổi 27 — 第三章：文字</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13702 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1,CLO2,CLO3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">Giáo trình chính<br>Slide theo bài</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1,CLO2,CLO3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">Giáo trình chính<br>Slide theo bài</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>第三章：文字<br>3.6 汉字的标准化</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Tham gia tích cực vào hoạt động trên lớp<br>Xem trước nội dung bài học để nắm được các định nghĩa</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Triển khai bài giảng theo đúng tiến độ</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>📑 School slides — 27.PLC401-CH3-20 (10 slides)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">matched by the chapter number in the deck name. File: 27.PLC401-CH3-20.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>📑 Slide của trường — 27.PLC401-CH3-20 (10 slide)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">ghép theo số chương ghi trong tên deck. Tệp: 27.PLC401-CH3-20.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CPL401/flm1/d27/001.webp\" alt=\"CPL401 · 27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 1: 现代汉语：语音、文字、词汇\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 1/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>现代汉语：语音、文字、词汇<br>PLC401</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CPL401/flm1/d27/002.webp\" alt=\"CPL401 · 27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 2: 第三章 文字3.6 汉字的标准化\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 2/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>第三章  文字3.6 汉字的标准化<br>四定：定量、定形、定音、定序<br>Dungnt3<br>5/8/2025</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CPL401/flm1/d27/003.webp\" alt=\"CPL401 · 27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 3: 定量\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 3/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>定量<br>1<br>定形<br>2<br>定音<br>3<br>定序<br>4<br>目录<br>3.6 汉字的标准化</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CPL401/flm1/d27/004.webp\" alt=\"CPL401 · 27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 4: 定量\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 4/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>定量<br>定量就是规定现代汉语用字的数量，包括常用汉字、通用汉字以及各类专业用字的数量。</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CPL401/flm1/d27/005.webp\" alt=\"CPL401 · 27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 5: 定形\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 5/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>定形<br>定形就是规定现代汉语用字的标准字形。汉字定形的主要工作，一是进一步整理异体字，二是整理异形词。</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CPL401/flm1/d27/006.webp\" alt=\"CPL401 · 27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 6: 定音\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 6/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>定音<br>定音就是规定现代汉语用字的标准读音。<br>现代汉语用字的读音是以北京语音为标准的，需要定音的主要是异读词的字音。</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CPL401/flm1/d27/007.webp\" alt=\"CPL401 · 27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 7: 定序\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 7/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>定序<br>定序就是规定现代汉语用字的排列顺序。</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CPL401/flm1/d27/008.webp\" alt=\"CPL401 · 27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 8: 是按照字形排列字的顺序，主要可分为部首法、笔画法和号码法三种部首法、笔画法、号码法等形序编排规则。\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 8/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>是按照字形排列字的顺序，主要可分为部首法、笔画法和号码法三种部首法、笔画法、号码法等形序编排规则。<br>部首法按部首编排单字<br>笔画法是根据笔画数和笔顺的顺序来编排<br>号码法是根据字形确定的号码编排汉字，常见的是四角号码法<br>形序法<br>字序规范</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CPL401/flm1/d27/009.webp\" alt=\"CPL401 · 27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 9: 按照字音排列字的顺序。\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 9/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>按照字音排列字的顺序。<br>现代的音序一般按照汉语拼音字母的顺序排列。<br>汉字同音字比较多相同音节。<br>音序法<br>字序规范</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/CPL401/flm1/d27/010.webp\" alt=\"CPL401 · 27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 10: 谢谢观看\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">27.PLC401-CH3-20 · slide 10/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>谢谢观看<br>Dungnt3<br>5/8/2025</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
